@@ -0,0 +1,123 @@
+/* Philips PCF50633 Input Driver
+ *
+ * (C) 2006-2008 by Openmoko, Inc.
+ * Author: Balaji Rao <balajirrao@openmoko.org>
+ * All rights reserved.
+ *
+ * Broken down from monstrous PCF50633 driver mainly by
+ * Harald Welte, Andy Green and Werner Almesberger
+ *
